    "updated_at": "2016-08-01T11:58:11Z",
    "body": "Poking at this today. For `frame-ancestor`, I expect to add the relevant hooks to CSP, and, then call them from https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#process-a-navigate-response. For `X-F-O`, I'll make up something that at least somewhat aligns with RFC7034.\n",
