    "created_at": "2016-08-02T13:58:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-02T13:58:31Z",
    "body": "\"Pretty easy to add\", he says.\n\nBasically, we didn't think about this enough, and it's more subtle than I though, because we need the source browsing context's policy in some cases (`form-action`), and the target browsing context's parent's policy in others (`frame-src`), and the response's policy in still others (`frame-ancestors`). I think these two hooks give me the tools I'll need to poke at things in CSP, but I wonder if there's a better way...\n\nWDYT?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
