    "body": "As mentioned in https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1599256 this should also define what kind of document does get loaded <s>(`about:blank`?)</s> and whether that creates a `load` event. (That's what Firefox will implement unless Chrome starts treating this as a network error soon.)",
